# Elusive Otter (1/1): "Creatures with power less than this creature's power can't block it" (CR 509.1b). Bot2's
# Ornithopter (power 0) may not block the Otter, but its Llanowar Elves (power 1, not less than 1) may, and the two trade.
# The Ornithopter is not barred from blocking in general: it blocks Bot1's own Ornithopter, which is the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Elusive Otter
Ornithopter
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Forest x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Elusive Otter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Elusive Otter > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter > Bot1.Battlefield.Elusive Otter)
Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves > Bot1.Battlefield.Elusive Otter; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter > Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Graveyard = Elusive Otter
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Ornithopter
